th","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Jane Hume","party":"Liberal","person_id":"tvfy_10853","person_slug":"jane-hume","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Janet Rice","party":"Greens","person_id":"tvfy_10836","person_slug":"janet-rice","vote":"no"},{"name":"Jim Molan","party":"Liberal","person_id":"tvfy_10904","person_slug":"jim-molan","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Jordon Steele-John","party":"Greens","person_id":"tvfy_10901","person_slug":"jordon-steele-john","vote":"no"},{"name":"Lidia Thorpe","party":"Independent","person_id":"tvfy_10961","person_slug":"lidia-thorpe","vote":"no"},{"name":"Matt O'Sullivan","party":"Liberal","person_id":"tvfy_10958","person_slug":"matt-osullivan","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Mehreen Faruqi","party":"Greens","person_id":"tvfy_10912","person_slug":"mehreen-faruqi","vote":"no"},{"name":"Murray Watt","party":"Labor","person_id":"tvfy_10857","person_slug":"murray-watt","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Nick McKim","party":"Greens","person_id":"tvfy_10841","person_slug":"nick-mckim","vote":"no"},{"name":"Paul Scarr","party":"Liberal","person_id":"tvfy_10949","person_slug":"paul-scarr","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Perin Davey","party":"Nationals","person_id":"tvfy_10947","person_slug":"perin-davey","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Peter Whish-Wilson","party":"Greens","person_id":"tvfy_10780","person_slug":"peter-whish-wilson","vote":"no"},{"name":"Raff Ciccone","party":"Labor","person_id":"tvfy_10915","person_slug":"raff-ciccone","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Rex Patrick","party":"Independent","person_id":"tvfy_10903","person_slug":"rex-patrick","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Sam McMahon","party":"Country Liberal Party","person_id":"tvfy_10948","person_slug":"sam-mcmahon","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Sarah Hanson-Young","party":"Greens","person_id":"tvfy_10711","person_slug":"sarah-hanson-young","vote":"no"},{"name":"Sarah Henderson","party":"Liberal","person_id":"tvfy_10790","person_slug":"sarah-henderson","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Susan McDonald","party":"Nationals","person_id":"tvfy_10951","person_slug":"susan-mcdonald","vote":"aye"},{"name":"Wendy Askew","party":"Liberal","person_id":"tvfy_10914","person_slug":"wendy-askew","vote":"aye"}],"name":"Treasury Laws Amendment (Cost of Living Support and Other Measures) Bill 2022 - in Committee - Ramsay Centre for Western Civilisation","noes":8,"question":"The majority voted in favour of a [motion](https://www.openaustralia.org.au/senate/?id=2022-03-30.194.1) to keep unchanged table item 2.2.55 of item (1) and item (8) of schedule 3. In parliamentary jargon, they voted that the items \"*stand as printed*.\" This vote took place after NSW Senator [Mehreen Faruqi](https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/people/senate/nsw/mehreen_faruqi) (Greens) proposed that they be opposed. Because this vote was successful, the items will remain as they are. ### What did these items do? [According to Senator Faruqi](https://www.openaustralia.org.au/senate/?id=2022-03-30.194.1): > *... here we have a government trying to sneak in deductible gift status for the [Ramsay Centre for Western Civilisation](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paul_Ramsay#Ramsay_Centre_for_Western_Civilisation), a move that will allow the centre to avoid taxation on their income. My amendment will stop this from happening.* But Victorian Senator [Jane Hume](https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/people/senate/victoria/jane_hume) (Liberal) disagreed, [saying](https://www.openaustralia.org.au/senate/?gid=2022-03-30.195.1): > *I think the senator has misunderstood what DGR status actually implies. It does not mean that the Ramsay centre doesn't pay tax; it means that donors to the Ramsay centre are allowed to deduct their donations.*","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-7680","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2022-03-30/8"}
